# Every file in this repository is consumed by other repositories in the
# organisation, so all changes require review from the DevOps owners.
#
# Replace @AOT-Technologies/devops with the real team slug, then require
# "Require review from Code Owners" in the branch protection ruleset for main.

*                       @AOT-Technologies/devops

# The workflow definitions themselves are the product. Guard them specifically
# so a broad rule change cannot silently loosen review on them.
/.github/workflows/     @AOT-Technologies/devops
/.github/scripts/       @AOT-Technologies/devops
